+- [x] 2.2 Implement FIXED/PERCENT discount computation with `maxDiscountCents` and amount caps, returning the re-read order; verify AC-01/AC-02/AC-04 amount tests pass.
+
+## 3. HTTP layer
+
+- [x] 3.1 Register `POST /orders/:id/apply-coupon` in `src/routes/orders.ts` returning HTTP 200 with the updated order; verify a request returns a body identical to a following `GET /orders/:id`.
+
+## 4. Tests
+
+- [x] 4.1 Add integration tests in `tests/` covering success (AC-01, AC-02, AC-03 cap, AC-04, AC-06, AC-07 boundaries), response equality with GET, and status preservation (AC-14/REQ-05).
+- [x] 4.2 Add integration tests covering every error code and the fixed precedence order, plus AC-08 (second apply rejected, amounts unchanged), AC-09 (`usedCount` +1 and one redemption row), AC-10 (`" save20 "` matches `SAVE20`), and REQ-13 body validation.
+
+## 5. Verification
+
+- [x] 5.1 Run `npm run build` and `npm test` and confirm both pass with no changes to existing tests or `TASK.md`.
